{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread","id":1344153,"title":"The New Gameline Speculation Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-28T02:03:44-07:00","id":1344153,"title":"The New Gameline Speculation Thread","content":"So yeah, you all knew it was coming, and its here.<br /> <br /> Like after every new gameline, it is the time to stop, look around and wonder where the CofD is going to go next. While we have no guarantee that the next big project will be a new gameline (it could be something like Mirrors, Dark Eras, Contagion, etc), but eventually, we expect that a new gameline will eventually turn up around here- the question is, what could it be?<br /> <br /> I must say, that after every new gameline, that questions becomes more and more difficult to answer- especially after we covered more or less all of the WoD gamelines. Beast and Deviant seem to have both worked hard to include a number of possible monsters into the same game, with the first including all kinds of mythological beasts and the later everything about human experimentation. Each of the gameline was somewhat expected, and yet surprising to actually get- and so I must ask, which new monster could, after 11 gamelines and many blue book splats, hold its ground and present an interesting, new take about the greater CofD world?<br /> <br /> Yeah, a difficult question for me. The only thing I can kinda think about is &quot;zombies&quot;, and even if we were to think about a playable version of that trope (like Zombie: the Coil did), it feels much more like something which should fall in Geist's alley. Inferno, while I love the book dearly, is extremely unlikely to get expanded into a full gameline due to Demon covering that niche- but the fact that we got Descent after Inferno means that it is not out of the picture to get a new gameline which covers something the a blue book already did. The only problem is that many of the said blue books are already covered by a larger gameline, to some degree (Second Sight by Mage, Skinthieves &amp; Changing Breeds by Werewolf, Immortals by Mummy, Slasher by Hunter, etc). While I qould have loved to see psychic as their own gameline, Deviant seems to have already taken whatever Mage and Beast didn't already covered. As such... yeah, I'm drawing blank in here.<br /> <br /> In short- what kind of new gameline do you think could still being created for the CofD, without feeling forced?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T06:08:15-07:00","id":1344177,"title":"","content":"One I've had rattling around in my head is doppelgangers. I'm not talking clones, like Promethean, or fetches, like Changeling, but...more tapping the doppelganger strain in horror fiction, where the doppelganger is either intent on taking over your life while you're still living it or drives you to obsession by what they show you about your own life. Maybe it'd be a blue-book thing, I don't know.<br /> <br /> Vance (the Exalted dev) once brought up that the one type of horror the Worlds of Darkness hadn't really done - or at least focused on - was the body-snatcher, as in Invasion of the Bodysnatchers, and I tried to think of how it could be done without (too much) violation of consent... which led to its antecedent, the doppelganger.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T07:10:40-07:00","id":1344185,"title":"","content":"I can see cryptids, like the animalistic anomalies trying to survive by not being found out. aliens is also a possibility, but VERY unlikely","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T08:30:44-07:00","id":1344196,"title":"","content":"I bet for Alien.<br /> Can you pass as human AND don give up your identity as an Outer One?<br /> The theme could be similiar but opposite to Descent: you seek a new place to live, and live as &quot;a Outer&quot; AND &quot;Earthling&quot; too.<br /> Can you adapt without lose your past identiy? Can integrate part of your culture and mash up with the local habit? Will your goal be a Subversion or a Syntetys?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":340,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":".  More idea 10-28-2019, 11:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T08:52:27-07:00","id":1344198,"title":"","content":"I don't have an specific kinda monster in mind. But how about this: an utterly inhuman being,completely from another level of reality. A thing completely other than human in all conceivable ways. Suddenly shoved In a human body,how will you react to becoming something so foreign to you","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T09:01:32-07:00","id":1344200,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344198#post1344198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't have an specific kinda monster in mind. But how about this: an utterly inhuman being,completely from another level of reality. A thing completely other than human in all conceivable ways. Suddenly shoved In a human body,how will you react to becoming something so foreign to you</div> </div> </div> </div>so like a lovecraftian creature? as long as that does not overlap with beast too much it sounds like a great idea","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T09:20:58-07:00","id":1344204,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344200#post1344200\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> so like a lovecraftian creature? as long as that does not overlap with beast too much it sounds like a great idea</div> </div> </div> </div>Lovecraft is one of the three main inspirations,the other are The Nothing from the NeverEndingStory. And the Entities from Worm<br /> And Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T09:25:27-07:00","id":1344206,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344200#post1344200\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> so like a lovecraftian creature? as long as that does not overlap with beast too much it sounds like a great idea</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm more worried for Demon overlap. They're the splat who explicitly sometimes wishes they didn't have as good a poker face so they could be more certain of their own emotions.<br /> <br /> I like Alien for the Body Snatcher idea, though. <br /> <br /> There's also that Fury pitch a few years back, I don't know from who. Essentially the idea was that you were a human who was anointed as a demigod of vengeance and order by Fate, with your own signature weapon. That sounds like a good beginning for a theme about humanity's relationship with fate, free will, and the law.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T09:33:31-07:00","id":1344210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344206#post1344206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's also that Fury pitch a few years back, I don't know from who. Essentially the idea was that you were a human who was anointed as a demigod of vengeance and order by Fate, with your own signature weapon. That sounds like a good beginning for a theme about humanity's relationship with fate, free will, and the law.</div> </div> </div> </div>Olivia Hill, which means it's never going to happen as is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T10:10:10-07:00","id":1344214,"title":"","content":"Alien: the Exile. You\u2019re not from this world, that doesn\u2019t mean you\u2019re from space, you might be from another dimension or some timeline that can no longer be, you might have fled here to escape the end of your reality or you might have been sentenced to this world but you\u2019re here now and it\u2019s not your home.<br /> Steve Jobs undeniably changed the world but did he do it to save the company that he made or was he trying to recreate a small part of the world left behind where silver flame shaped into a flat screen to allow communication and reading of knowledge? Lovecraft had a poor head for mathematics and science yet he made people gifted in these fields the heroes of his stories, was he trying to distance himself from a part of his nature he didn\u2019t want to face? Could there be more to Highlander 2 than we think?<br /> Aliens are not of this world but they seek to bring some small part of it here integrating ideas into their life and possibly the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T10:14:56-07:00","id":1344216,"title":"","content":"Do why really need Another game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T10:32:49-07:00","id":1344220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344216#post1344216\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do why really need Another game?</div> </div> </div> </div>no. but would you really be averse to another game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T10:37:27-07:00","id":1344221,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344206#post1344206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm more worried for Demon overlap. They're the splat who explicitly sometimes wishes they didn't have as good a poker face so they could be more certain of their own emotions.<br /> <br /> I like Alien for the Body Snatcher idea, though. <br /> <br /> There's also that Fury pitch a few years back, I don't know from who. Essentially the idea was that you were a human who was anointed as a demigod of vengeance and order by Fate, with your own signature weapon. That sounds like a good beginning for a theme about humanity's relationship with fate, free will, and the law.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the main issue with a new gameline isnt necessarily that we have so many now, but coming up with an archetypical supernatural creature. we have the main ones like Mummy and Vampire, then we have the collective archetypes like deviant, beast, and changeling. now we have to really think about a recognizable pop culture monster people would want to play","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T10:39:55-07:00","id":1344222,"title":"","content":"Conspiracy. Taking advantage of and broadening the set up from Deviant and Geist (and maybe Mummy and Hunter?) play someone who found themselves in what is now a conspiracy or cult the mandate of which has taken a drastic and likely violent turn, leaving you stuck in the unenviable position of wanting to leave but knowing you'll be persecuted or killed for it, or trying to change the ways of the group in a subtle enough manner you don't get taken aside by whoever the enforcers are and killed. And of course once you grasp the reins you are now burdened with the mantle of leadership and forced to live up to people's expectations and also not turn the group around so much that some lowly decides its time they started angling for your position to get things back on their perceived right track.<br /> <br /> I suppose it could even act as a crossover game, but rather than Beast's external entities glomming onto existing splats, you have an expansion of existing splats and their politics. And expanding on that, I'd rather have expanding on existing games, and if we get new big lines things like Dark Eras and Mirrors, rather than a new gameline. I want more books for the games I like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-28-2019, 01:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T11:21:25-07:00","id":1344229,"title":"","content":"I don't expect there to be another gameline for a while, since there's been a decent outpouring of them since 2013-since then, we've gotten Mummy, Demon, Beast*, and Deviant, alongside Dark Eras and Contagion as big event tickets. I imagine now's a decent time for a differently angled Big Event Ticket and otherwise taking a second to really build up and flesh out the Current Second Edition bunch.<br /> <br /> So if I may propose an expansion on the original topic ( <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar503_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"503\" data-vbnamecard=\"503\">LostLight</a> , feel free to decline this), what would also be a Big Project like Dark Eras or Contagion you'd like to see?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, Zombie is pretty well covered by Geist and Deviant-and now someone is going to make the Zombieland Saga girls into Deviants.<br /> <br /> It won't be me, but someone will.<br /> <br /> *The main thing I'd want, honestly, is a 1.5 Edition of Beast next. Even as much I love the game, I think it's easy to own that it's the roughest of the new batch, and I think a fair number of us have ideas on how to clean it up. That said, that's it's own thread, not this one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 10-28-2019, 02:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T14:21:03-07:00","id":1344255,"title":"","content":"I'm also not expecting a new gameline soon. I do think we've seen a lot of possible stories and really a good approach would be to really dig in and add more expanded companion books to any/all lines that there is left to add to.<br /> <br /> <i>That said</i>, it's fun to speculate. So! I've been hoping for years now for something that draws upon the Djinn/Jinn. I don't really have straight up horror examples from popular culture that could be used to tell but what's always fascinating about the non-Disney mentions around the lore of Djinn is just how <i>other </i>they are.<br /> <br /> There was a post I made in another thread <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/960027-what-monsters-are-left/page10\">Here </a>that I go into my thought process so I won't go over here.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T15:04:38-07:00","id":1344266,"title":"","content":"As someone who is really excited towards the upcoming Hearteaters, I would really like an occult- ish take over the Body Snatchers theme. Sure, it may be partially covered by Body Thieves, but again, that didn't stopped Promethean, Geist, Mummy and Demon, so it won't be out of the picture.. and yeah, Fury is probably not going to see the light of day, unfortunately.<br /> <br /> Talking about Exalted, it could be a nice base for speculating over a new splat type. We all know the basic connections- Solar for Hunter, Sidereal for Mage, Lunar for Werewolf, Abyssal for Vampire. Dragon Blooded was corresponded to either the infamous Gypsies book, or the Kindred of the East (which was a really weak connection, IMO). Infernals are likely to correspond to Demon, even though in CofD, Alchemicals are doing it better. Liminals were partially inspired by Promethean, and I remember that Exigents was mentioned as inspiration for Deviant in one of the blog posts. As for the new Exalts, I have a strong gut feeling that the Dream Souled are likely to correspond to the themes of Beast.<br /> <br /> So we have Dragon Blooded and Infernals/ Alchemicals, as well as the new Getimian, Umbral and Hearteaters as possible sources of inspiration for a new gameline. On the other hand, as we have two &quot;demon splats&quot; (Descent and Inferno), I could see both Infernals and Alchemicals being covered. So we have elemental-dragon-blood-magic things, time-travel-paradox-things, body-snatcher-psychics-things and something-weird-dark-shadow-not-mr-hyde-things. Oh, and the Spoken, which are practically siren-sea-monster-things, which may be somewhat included by Beast, but again, that never stopped Mummy.<br /> <br /> It's something. not much, but something.<br /> <br /> And yeah, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar99_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"99\" data-vbnamecard=\"99\">ArcaneArts</a>, I agree that the chances are that we are not going to see a new gameline anytime soon, and that it is far more likely we will see a Big Project of some kind or two in the meanwhile, but speculating is fun. The reason that I suggested speculating a new gameline is because the Big Project could be anything, and is less likely to be predicted by speculation IMO, but if you have a good idea for what it could be- sure, feel free to share. Feels dumb to make an whole new speculation thread for it :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T16:40:17-07:00","id":1344297,"title":"","content":"I would like to see a book covering normal people searching for occult power with things like cults and items of power but such a book has a lot of overlap with existing lines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T17:57:48-07:00","id":1344306,"title":"","content":"I would say Cult: The Summoning.<br /> <br /> Have a game line focused on being part of a cult and someday leading one. With the end goal of summoning some creature or bringing about the apocalypse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24020-mateus","name":"Mateus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24020_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T18:06:12-07:00","id":1344308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344306#post1344306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would say Cult: The Summoning.<br /> <br /> Have a game line focused on being part of a cult and someday leading one. With the end goal of summoning some creature or bringing about the apocalypse.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hunter, what are you doing here?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T18:06:13-07:00","id":1344309,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344297#post1344297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would like to see a book covering normal people searching for occult power with things like cults and items of power but such a book has a lot of overlap with existing lines.</div> </div> </div> </div>honestly, with how people make blue books like Innocents sound. I'm sure a cult game would be great (even with Hunter interlap since some conspiracies are cults)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T18:06:21-07:00","id":1344310,"title":"","content":"If it's just regular people it sounds a lot more likea blue book supplement than a separate game. Or secondary/tertiary protagonists in another game, like human pack/krewe/Arisen cult members.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T18:13:33-07:00","id":1344311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344222#post1344222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Conspiracy. Taking advantage of and broadening the set up from Deviant and Geist (and maybe Mummy and Hunter?) play someone who found themselves in what is now a conspiracy or cult the mandate of which has taken a drastic and likely violent turn, leaving you stuck in the unenviable position of wanting to leave but knowing you'll be persecuted or killed for it, or trying to change the ways of the group in a subtle enough manner you don't get taken aside by whoever the enforcers are and killed. And of course once you grasp the reins you are now burdened with the mantle of leadership and forced to live up to people's expectations and also not turn the group around so much that some lowly decides its time they started angling for your position to get things back on their perceived right track.</div> </div> </div> </div>This sounds like a Devoted game of <i>Deviant</i>.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I like the doppelganger/body-snatcher idea, and would like to see the Furies for a sort of Ghost Rider/Spirit of Vengeance mash-up with different ideas of fate and destiny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T19:04:59-07:00","id":1344320,"title":"","content":"There still isn't anything official for mermaids, selkies, or Creature From the Black Lagoon-type monsters, though to be honest that could easily be folded into a game about aliens (outsiders in an unfamiliar culture trying to blend in), and also runs into some logistical problems. Body-snatchers/Doppelgangers is an interesting idea. Something I think could be cool is a large Kickstarter-worthy book that contains 2nd Edition updates for a lot of the blue books, like Inferno, Second Sight, Changing Breeds, etc. That would obviously come with its own logistical problems (What if you really only care about rules for psychics and can't stand any of the other minor templates? Are you really going to slap down thirty dollars on a bunch of rules you'll never touch? How do you even organize a book that doesn't have a coherent theme?), but could be a feasible way to get conversions for things that otherwise risk gathering dust for quite some time.<br /> <br /> A thoughtful deconstruction of the &quot;tainted blood&quot; trope would also get my attention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T09:16:20-07:00","id":1344432,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344220#post1344220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> no. but would you really be averse to another game?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> not the OP, but i'm of course happy to have them create whatever they like, but personally speaking, i think there's a lot of game bloat and another new line isn't what i'm looking for.<br /> <br /> i'd like to expand the lines we have, maybe get some LARP rules we can use. or, most interesting to me, start moving CofD into StoryPath as i think 2E is getting a bit long in the tooth.<br /> <br /> but that's just my .02.<br /> <br /> i say this as i'm finishing up a Promethean campaign and prepping a 2E Requiem for Rome campaign, tho. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZinR2EXjdSmNAlIoj0eVUtNW61dvSgz-45XyKTOQt4g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">VtR 2v5 Homebrew: VtR 2e base with my favorite V5 mechanics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/241-nicodemus","name":"nicodemus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar241_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T09:48:13-07:00","id":1344439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nicodemus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344432#post1344432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> not the OP, but i'm of course happy to have them create whatever they like, but personally speaking, i think there's a lot of game bloat and another new line isn't what i'm looking for.<br /> <br /> i'd like to expand the lines we have, maybe get some LARP rules we can use. or, most interesting to me, start moving CofD into StoryPath as i think 2E is getting a bit long in the tooth.<br /> <br /> but that's just my .02.<br /> <br /> i say this as i'm finishing up a Promethean campaign and prepping a 2E Requiem for Rome campaign, tho. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>personally I agree to the point a new gameline should not come soon. I'd also rather get the gamelines and overall world fleshed out more (promethean players/storytellers guide anyone?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T10:44:09-07:00","id":1344446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nicodemus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344432#post1344432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> not the OP, but i'm of course happy to have them create whatever they like, but personally speaking, i think there's a lot of game bloat and another new line isn't what i'm looking for.<br /> <br /> i'd like to expand the lines we have, maybe get some LARP rules we can use. or, most interesting to me, start moving CofD into StoryPath as i think 2E is getting a bit long in the tooth.<br /> <br /> but that's just my .02.</div> </div> </div> </div>The thing is that, on the paper, the expansion of previous gamelines should not be dependent on the creation of a new Big Project, be it a new gameline or something like Dark Eras and its like. The expansion of other lines more or less depends on how good they sell, and how convincing is the pitching to the supervisors (I think. I am not a part of the system after all). While I assume that having a limited resources in terms of writers, developers and money may cause reduce the attention of the older gamelines on the expanse of creating a new one, but the point is that, IMO, the CofD needs new Big Projects in need to survive. It draws attention and new blood, after all.<br /> <br /> And yeah, I would not hold my breath for yet another change in the system anytime soon. Hunter and Mummy, the last 1e games to be converted, are on the waiting list for a 2e Kickstarter, and I would be very surprised for a change edition right after it finish converting all the old lines. Edition changes are always harsh, to say the least, and are risky, even for another system which already exists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T12:13:13-07:00","id":1344466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>espritdecalmar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344320#post1344320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There still isn't anything official for mermaids, selkies, or Creature From the Black Lagoon-type monsters, though to be honest that could easily be folded into a game about aliens (outsiders in an unfamiliar culture trying to blend in), and also runs into some logistical problems. Body-snatchers/Doppelgangers is an interesting idea. Something I think could be cool is a large Kickstarter-worthy book that contains 2nd Edition updates for a lot of the blue books, like Inferno, Second Sight, Changing Breeds, etc. That would obviously come with its own logistical problems (What if you really only care about rules for psychics and can't stand any of the other minor templates? Are you really going to slap down thirty dollars on a bunch of rules you'll never touch? How do you even organize a book that doesn't have a coherent theme?), but could be a feasible way to get conversions for things that otherwise risk gathering dust for quite some time.<br /> <br /> A thoughtful deconstruction of the &quot;tainted blood&quot; trope would also get my attention.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mermaids, selkies, Creature of the Black Lagoon-Beast and Changeling<br /> Aliens-Changeling and Demon<br /> Body Snatchers-Demon<br /> Doppelgangers-Demon, Beast, Changeling<br /> <br /> <br /> I could get behind a big book of updated 2e minor templates.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T13:18:40-07:00","id":1344485,"title":"","content":"While it will never ever happened, I would really like to just get an official leviathan game. While it is similar to a lot of other game line it's also has a very unique feel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24309-mheh12","name":"mheh12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T13:28:12-07:00","id":1344489,"title":"","content":"I won't say it would be out of the picture to get a Black Lagoon style splat, for even though (like Arc said), Beast and Changeling have covered it to some degree, if the Mekhet, the Osiris, the Purified and Geist didn't stop Mummy, and Inferno (as well as countless other demonic mentions) didn't stop Demon, if someone would offer a really good pitch I won't be surprised to see a sea monster like splat, even though it would probably won't be &quot;Leviathan&quot; as we know it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T13:47:47-07:00","id":1344492,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mheh12</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344485#post1344485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While it will never ever happened, I would really like to just get an official leviathan game. While it is similar to a lot of other game line it's also has a very unique feel.</div> </div> </div> </div>Deviant actually covers a bizarre amount of Leviathan's niche, between incredibly unhealthy relationship dynamics based around a bifurcated Integrity analogue and a burgeoning instability in one's occult state, being pursued by coordinated groups of people for various reasons relating to your supernatural qualities, highly graduated powers and drawbacks, and a list of power options that include &quot;is amphibious/aquatic,&quot; &quot;turns into an animal up to the size of a whale,&quot; &quot;is very large,&quot; &quot;has supernaturally potent bodily resources,&quot; &quot;grab bag of psychic abilities,&quot; &quot;controls the weather,&quot; and so on down the line.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T14:27:27-07:00","id":1344505,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344220#post1344220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> no. but would you really be averse to another game?</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly I\u2019d rather see more resources go toward supplements expanding the games we have (or are imminently getting) at the moment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T16:28:35-07:00","id":1344521,"title":"","content":"I could see something like<i> Outsiders: The Strangers.</i> It might include all sorts of unearthly types:<ul><li>A four dimensional scientist who got trapped in our 3D world.</li> <li>A bona fide alien who crash-landed.</li> <li>An alien probe that lost its programming</li> <li>A spirit that rode back to Earth from a Mars mission (Hey, they can't all be Idigams).</li> <li>An elf cannibal from a parallel plane where humans were food beasts.</li> </ul>Different agendas could be:<ul><li>Invasion: get more of your kind here.</li> <li>Protect: Earth is your adopted home/plane. You can see the dangers poor Dirters can't.</li> <li>Escape: Got to get back home!</li> <li>Reproduce: It's so lonely here!</li> </ul>PC's would have to develop their own &quot;<a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/BlueAndOrangeMorality\" target=\"_blank\">Blue-Orange Morality</a>&quot; that sets them apart. There would be a natural tendency for Outsiders to notice each other, and perhaps therefore interact with each other. Some natural story themes would be similar to Demon and Promethean (revealing otherness, fear of being hunted, trying to find a home, maybe choosing to be human). It differs from Promethean in that Created have to invent their own culture and values, where Outsiders already have one that is unacceptable or doesn't fit the human world. The storyline could fit in to the GMC or not, as desired.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T16:59:23-07:00","id":1344527,"title":"","content":"I could go with just alien invaders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T17:54:41-07:00","id":1344540,"title":"","content":"I could see any or all of these being potentially interesting, but I\u2019m also suffering from lack of Mage content.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T18:01:43-07:00","id":1344541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344466#post1344466\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mermaids, selkies, Creature of the Black Lagoon-Beast and Changeling<br /> Aliens-Changeling and Demon<br /> Body Snatchers-Demon<br /> Doppelgangers-Demon, Beast, Changeling<br /> <br /> <br /> I could get behind a big book of updated 2e minor templates.</div> </div> </div> </div>is your point to show all of these are already covered, or you can stretch the definition of the splats to involve every mythological monster?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T18:12:53-07:00","id":1344544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344541#post1344541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> is your point to show all of these are already covered, or you can stretch the definition of the splats to involve every mythological monster?</div> </div> </div> </div>Both and neither? if I had to pick one, the former.<br /> <br /> But also just pointing out that if someone were out to make such entities, those are the things they need to differentiate themselves from.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T18:14:43-07:00","id":1344545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1344505#post1344505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly I\u2019d rather see more resources go toward supplements expanding the games we have (or are imminently getting) at the moment.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah the more ideas I see the more I turn towards this.<br /> <br /> Also while it may have just been part of the last two books (Beast, Deviant) they seem more inclined towards broader ideas rather than a more static mythological background and player character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T18:21:01-07:00","id":1344546,"title":"","content":"With the upcoming Clades Companion for Deviant, there aren't actually any other stories I don't know how to tell with CofD at this point.<br /> <br /> I don't know that we need a new gameline. I'd be interested in new material applicable across gamelines, maybe a future-era equivalent to Dark Eras? Alternatively, a lot more Night Horrors books, or books to flesh out and expand 2E lines, or official guides on converting 1E material to 2E, on a gameline-by-gameline basis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T20:22:37-07:00","id":1344562,"title":"","content":"I get that OPP wants to focus on big projects (like Dark Eras, Contagion Chronicle and new gamelines) that bring a lot of hype and attract people through Kickstarters, but I really miss the old style of small but focused supplements. Dark Eras are absolutely cool and highly interesting, but sometimes I want to spice up a normal game rather than go to a whole new alternate setting. I miss books like Midnight Roads and (to a lesser extent) Reliquary that gave advice and material for basic games, and books like Inferno and Second Sight that unlocked more options for both the characters and the setting of any given game.<br /> I'm not saying those books should be updated (since I know OPP prefers writing new material rather than treading old ground) but books like those. Like a book for running different types of cults in the game, or a book for running investigations of various kinds.<br /> <br /> Here'sone suggestion:<br /> Unspeakable Cults<br /> Chapter 1: A breakdown of cults in media and in real life; advice for handling the subject matter<br /> Chapter 2: What a cult is in the context of CofD; what is needed to build a cult for a game<br /> Chapter 3: Cults as an extension of the player characters; building cults like Krewes from GtSE<br /> Chapter 4: Cults as antagonists; building cults like Conspiracies from DtR<br /> Chapter 5: Cult benefits in rules terms and example cults","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T20:40:23-07:00","id":1344565,"title":"","content":"Can't really think of anything as a major gameline aside from Aliens.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5557-runcible","name":"Runcible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5557_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T17:38:00-08:00","id":1345673,"title":"","content":"How about a Neolithic Era supplement covering every game line?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T18:08:31-08:00","id":1345680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1345673#post1345673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about a Neolithic Era supplement covering every game line?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dawnworld meets Chronicles is well liked by a certain obscure to all but a few artist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-04T01:53:59-08:00","id":1345733,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1344153-the-new-gameline-speculation-thread?p=1345673#post1345673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about a Neolithic Era supplement covering every game line?</div> </div> </div> </div>This!<br /> <br /> <br /> Other than that, really the only thing I could think of would be Aliens.<br /> (Failed) Invasion, Crashed, Researching/Scouting, Banned... Trying to return, trying to integrate/hide, trying to take over, trying